{"4215820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dread Eagle", "steam_appid": 4215820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/e282fd86b22c0a4057d364986b70c019.avif?t=1778933877\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras_big/e282fd86b22c0a4057d364986b70c019.webp?t=1778933877 width=1560 height=477 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYNOPSIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dread Eagle</strong></i> is a psychological horror experience set in a secret Romanian facility where a Soviet experiment led by <strong>Sebastian Dobrev</strong> is just happening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore its depths, uncover disturbing truths, and face what remains of the test subjects. Survive the nightmare alone in <strong>singleplayer</strong> or together with friends in <strong>multiplayer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/305742b4b30128e61e58b92dc351ccc7.poster.avif?t=1778933877\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/305742b4b30128e61e58b92dc351ccc7.webm?t=1778933877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/305742b4b30128e61e58b92dc351ccc7.mp4?t=1778933877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/746a2f8a9682c8656304b25c1dc43c01.poster.avif?t=1778933877\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/746a2f8a9682c8656304b25c1dc43c01.webm?t=1778933877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/746a2f8a9682c8656304b25c1dc43c01.mp4?t=1778933877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped inside <strong>Unitatea 91-C</strong>, a hidden Soviet facility deep in Romania. <strong>Dread Eagle</strong> features a <strong>singleplayer</strong> campaign and competitive <strong>1v1</strong> and <strong>2v2</strong> modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round starts with a twisted Russian roulette, where players are linked to a shared gas system and one pump seals the outcome. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losing the gamble does not kill you, but sends you to an execution chamber. The winner must carry out the execution while surviving deadly threats, as the defeated player returns as a hostile force determined to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/c07f89f5fcdf269edb168bfe55e29c7d.poster.avif?t=1778933877\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/c07f89f5fcdf269edb168bfe55e29c7d.webm?t=1778933877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/c07f89f5fcdf269edb168bfe55e29c7d.mp4?t=1778933877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/9786f95867d4430d6ad9cbd8fabe7f48.poster.avif?t=1778933877\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/9786f95867d4430d6ad9cbd8fabe7f48.webm?t=1778933877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/9786f95867d4430d6ad9cbd8fabe7f48.mp4?t=1778933877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer</strong> <br>Experience the nightmare alone or compete with others in <strong>1v1</strong> and <strong>2v2</strong> modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Russian Roulette Gameplay</strong> <br>A deadly gas-based roulette system where every round begins with a life-or-death choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execution Phase Mechanics</strong> <br>Win the round and carry out the execution while surviving environmental hazards and unpredictable threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Controlled Antagonists</strong> <br>Defeated players return as hostile entities, actively trying to stop the execution and protect their former body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Atmosphere</strong> <br>Set inside Unitatea 91-C, a decaying Soviet facility filled with tension, dread, and disturbing details.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/ffc5ee25adffe1ad6c5683b5f2e27574.poster.avif?t=1778933877\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4215820/extras/ffc5ee25adffe1ad6c5